{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"根(Lie代数)"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“根 (Lie 代数)”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>注意区分"},{"Local":{"url":"根","text":"根"}},{"Plain":" (root).</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathfrak g$ 为有限维 Lie 代数, 那么存在一个"},{"Local":{"url":"可解","text":"可解 Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":"理想 $\\mathfrak r$ 包含所有的可解理想, 称之为 $\\mathfrak g$ 的根 (radical).</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"半单Lie代数","text":"半单 Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}